{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"tritanopia-safe","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Tritanopia Safe","description":"Reds, teals and pinks that stay distinct when blue and yellow look alike.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Tritanopia Safe","path":"themes/tritanopia-safe.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/tritanopia-safe.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Tritanopia Safe\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#1a1416\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#efe4e6\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#150f11\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#100b0d\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#100b0d\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#150f11\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#2a1f22\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#5a2f3c\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#2a1f22\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#150f11\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#100b0d\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#ff7c8c\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#ff7c8c\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#ff7c8c\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#5a2f3c\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#2a1f2280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#ff7c8c\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#100b0d\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#ff4d6a\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#4fd1c5\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#ffb3bd\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#ff6b81\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9a8388\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4fd1c5\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff9aa8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff6b81\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7fe0d8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffb3bd\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff9aa8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c9eeea\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff6b81\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4fd1c5\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffb3bd\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Tritanopia Safe\n\nReds, teals and pinks that stay distinct when blue and yellow look alike.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Tritanopia Safe** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi. Colors picked to stay distinct for blue-yellow color blindness.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#1a1416` |\n| Text | `#efe4e6` |\n| Accent | `#ff7c8c` |\n| Keywords | `#ff6b81` |\n| Strings | `#4fd1c5` |\n| Functions | `#ffb3bd` |\n| Types | `#7fe0d8` |\n| Comments | `#9a8388` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}